<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\監視カメラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Assistant Inspector Ise</STYLE>, I found it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm, good."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So they used the train. The Kogori couple owned a car, didn't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, but on this day they apparently went to Megasawa City by train."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... I don't get it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If they own a car, why go out of their way to take the train... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Had they been drinking or something?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And their movements after that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We're checking with the Iizawa Prefectural Police now, and if possible we'll have them send the recorded footage from Megasawa Station."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... Six people suddenly vanished from Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Three from the Kogori family, two from the Niimura family, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, they went to a Niimura family memorial service, didn't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, we've confirmed that with the school the three of them attend."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Which means what we don't understand is what the Kogori couple did. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The three high school girls headed to the Arata settlement by train, and then for some reason the Kogori couple boarded a train too, at a different time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And then they went missing, just like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All right, once the footage arrives from the Iizawa Prefectural Police, we'll resume the investigation with the video. For now, dismissed. Get back to the field."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, sir!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩くずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What on earth is going on...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　For the Kogori couple to go missing too..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
